{
  "uid": "catalyst-relay-workers",
  "title": "Catalyst \u00b7 Relay Workers",
  "description": "Per-ticket spend, tokens and health for laptop relay workers (and future Cloudflare container runners). A series is a relay worker iff it carries catalyst_ticket. Requires the collector-side attribution copies in transform/logs AND a dispatcher whose OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES actually survives ~/.claude/settings.json.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "style": "dark",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "liveNow": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "tags": [
    "catalyst",
    "relay",
    "observability",
    "cost"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "bucket",
        "type": "interval",
        "label": "Interval",
        "query": "1m,5m,15m,30m,1h,6h,1d",
        "current": {
          "text": "15m",
          "value": "15m"
        },
        "auto": false,
        "auto_count": 30,
        "auto_min": "10s",
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 2,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "ticket",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Ticket",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total, catalyst_ticket)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Grafana --"
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Catalyst \u00b7 Relay Workers \u2014 what is each ticket costing, and is the relay healthy?\nThe mini execution-core daemons are **retired**. Work now runs as **laptop relay workers** (one `claude -p` per ticket, dispatched by `relay-dispatch.sh`) and, later, as **Cloudflare container runners**.\n\n**A series belongs to a relay worker iff it carries a `catalyst_ticket` label** \u2014 interactive sessions never set one. That is the relay-vs-interactive discriminator used by every panel here; `app_entrypoint` (bottom row) is the finer-grained split once `OTEL_METRICS_INCLUDE_ENTRYPOINT=1` is set.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f **These panels stay empty until BOTH halves ship.** The collector half (promoting `catalyst.ticket` / `catalyst.phase` / `service.instance.id` / `app.entrypoint` to labels) is in this repo. The **emit** half is `relay-dispatch.sh`, and its `OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES` is currently **discarded** \u2014 `~/.claude/settings.json` has an `env` block that overrides `OTEL_SERVICE_NAME`, `OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES` and `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` for every session on the box. Until the dispatcher passes its OTel config a way that wins (e.g. `--settings`), relay telemetry lands anonymously under `service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=\"laptop\"`.\n\nCounters are per-session and expire 15m after the last sample, so **every total uses `increase(...[$__range])`**, never a bare counter value."
      }
    },
    {
